    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dola",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata Abimeleki ghang'eat Dola was orjeeda Bua was orjeeda Dodo, siida gheeh Isakari gwalealu Israeli nea abeeda niny goobiita Shamiri jeeda ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoaw siida laja girgweaguutka bea Israeli aba gweanyeew diktam ea samwagu ng'ata ghami ak geebung'sa Shamiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yairi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata niny ghang'eat Yairi, siida eemeeda Gileyadi ak eara niny ghoah siida laja girgweaguutka bea Israeli aba gweanyeew diktam ea iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny gaba orju diktam ea damanamughuush nea inyeesa gwading'iida gureendiga digeeniga was diktam ea damanamughuush, nea saawa gwandeawa mujiinaji diktam ea damanamughuush, siguura Hawot-yairi bwak ea ghoah ghamneawa, nea gwanda ng'eanyiida Gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghami Yairi ak geebung'sa Gamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yefta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikta gicha fuga Israeli gwasin ramaseanda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gagadiiyeesa Baali ea Ashtaroti ea aseecheeka Shaamu ea gea Sidoni, ea gea Moabu, ea gea fuga Amoni, ea gea Filisti, nea ghwanung'wa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea ea mudu gagadiiyeesa niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesa nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA heeda fuga Israeli, ak ghwayiin geatinga fuga Filisti, ea geatinga orjooga Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooyuuk nea ghwanung' gwasawana diibiga Israeli aba gweaydida; gwasawana fuga sean bea Israeli mida giigheawda Yordani jeeda ng'eanyiida fuga Amori, mida Gileyadi, aba jeemba gweanyeew sis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoaghaawa Yordani fuga Amoni gaweay gang'uchi sea Yuda, ea Benjamini, ea gheeda Efraimu; nea aba damandida Israeli geeyuuk muuchi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gooyeawusa fuga Israeli NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayeeniisa, “Aseasa sisinneey riing'eeda, aba gideaba sinung'i heeda ASEETEANYA ak geegadiyeesi Baali.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Israeli, “Aniini mealealnaneegwa heeda fuga Misri, ea heeda fuga Amori, Amoni ea heeda fuga Filisti? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eara fuga Sidoni, ea Amaleki, ea Maoni gwasawaneegwa, ak gooyeawusean, ak gealealnaneegwa geatinga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea noanung'waadanaan, ak googadiyeesi aseecheeka suuk, ak ghamneawa aba ng'asheesu maygudu dalealneegwa gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aweayeena ak gooyeawusi aseecheeka ghayi oaghwali, ak ghwanung' gwalealneegwa damanda sawanaduutkeagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha fuga Israeli NG'UTAMIIDA, “Aseasa sisinyi riing'eeda; simaneasa gididaahi ea doabiwaat aba headaang'u; geemuscheey, lealneasa eaweecheanji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanda aseecheeka mayoamba mida bugusta nyaawa ak gagadiiyeesa NG'UTAMIIDA ak gagiisan gurooroadaanyi aba sawanaduutka fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoamughuush geat fuga Amoni ea dabita nyaawa, ak gooduuw museasooniga nyaawa aba Gileyadi, ak ghapka hijagi fuga Israeli ak gooduuw aba museasajeega nyaawa aba Mispa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak buuneeda was sugoodiga Gileyadi gaba nih eesha niirja, “Gaygoosheeda ng'eaha gang'uchi sea fuga Amoni. Gayghoah sugoocheanda fuga sean bea ng'eanyiida Gileyadi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
